    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of a totally normal robot vacuum in a total normal human world. Clean messes, roll around the house, and experience life as a robot vacuum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 3rd person little adventure game you take on the responsibilities of being a robot vacuum! You'll roll around the house cleaning up messes, making sure to keep the house clean, then return to base to end the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you clean you might notice the owner of the house having conversations, perhaps they are important?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing as a robot vacuum</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cleaning messes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >listening in on conversations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and did I mention.. cleaning messes??</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of a totally normal robot vacuum in a total normal human world. Clean messes, roll around the house, and experience life as a robot vacuum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 3rd person little adventure game you take on the responsibilities of being a robot vacuum! You'll roll around the house cleaning up messes, making sure to keep the house clean, then return to base to end the day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you clean you might notice the owner of the house having conversations, perhaps they are important?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features include:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing as a robot vacuum</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >cleaning messes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >listening in on conversations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and did I mention.. cleaning messes??</p>",
    "short_description": "Assume the role of a Robot vacuum and roll around cleaning up messes in this short 3rd person adventure!",
